//! Native Settings tab application.
//!
//! This is an adapter over the shipping preference metadata and About/Update
//! models, not a second persistence or updater implementation. It is the
//! renderer-native Settings surface: every route lives in an aterm tab and
//! emits typed host effects through [`crate::native_ui`].

